{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52523","headline":"观雪篇 · 陈元光","name":"观雪篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不敢希酿泉，忻然覩香雪。\n圭璧充庭辉，山林变瑶阙。\n农郊卜岁丰，帅阃和民悦。\n触檐鸣瑀珩，拂衙凛铁钺。\n藻台净冰监，茶壶团素月。\n圣恩宏海陬，边臣効芹说。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}